 R←Test_SendEmail_21(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;res;qdmx
⍝ SendEmailExample: the error message is reported, and a missing left argument is an error
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewParms
 parms.Password←'wrong'
 res←parms SMTP.SendEmailExample'john.doe@example.com'
 →T.PassesIf'Failed with rc=1; 535 5.7.8 Authentication credentials invalid'≡res

 :Trap 11
     res←SMTP.SendEmailExample'john.doe@example.com'
     →T.PassesIf 0
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.PassesIf'Left argument must be an instance of ConnectionParameters'≡qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
